{%- comment -%}
  sections/header_luxury_v1.liquid
  CONVERSION PSYCHOLOGY & ARCHITECTURE (480+ lines):
  1. COGNITIVE EASE & SYMMETRY: High-net-worth buyers demand architectural symmetry and effortless navigation. A centered Bodoni wordmark flanked by clean navigation balances visual prestige with conversion clarity.
  2. DYNAMIC SCARCITY TICKER (Urgency Framing): Rotating announcement messages ("ONLY 4 PIECES REMAINING FOR ASIA-PACIFIC") reinforces vault exclusivity without tacky countdown timers.
  3. MEGA-MENU CURATION: Hover/click mega-panels guide users directly to high-margin horology and saddlery collections with embedded spotlight imagery.
  4. ZEIGARNIK TELEMETRY BADGES: Highlighting active wishlist and cart quantities creates open loops that drive transaction completion.
  5. ZERO EMOJI GUARANTEE: Uses verified ASCII brackets [ VAULT ALLOCATION ], [ SEARCH ATELIER ], [ CART: 2 ], and obsidian/gold styling.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign section_id = 'lx-head-' | append: section.id -%}

<style>
  #{{ section_id }} {
